                        </h6>

                        <ul>
                            <li><code>num1</code> stores 12.</li>
                            <li><code>num2</code> stores 8.</li>
                            <li><code>sum</code> stores the addition result.</li>
                            <li>The output will be <b>20</b>.</li>
                        </ul>

                    </li>


                    <!-- BOOLEAN -->

                    <li class="mb-4">

                        <h6 class="fw-bold">
                            Using Boolean Variables
                        </h6>

                        <p>
                            This example shows how a boolean variable can be used
